        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jisu rana kross phung nicho?",
            "Mei guai pumsa tatna;",
            "Ram e mei kathui khang kross nai,",
            "Hei kross tei akhang e.",
            "",
            "2. Katpat mei kross tei ai phungni,",
            "Apanti ngan maksan;",
            "Hei tang tingkauh kai njuanni,",
            "Khou tei pirun lani.",
            "",
            "3. Kangranmei kross tiangdang khou tei,",
            "Jisu phaibang khou tei;",
            "Neilamei pirun lou kei ni,",
            "Kajan suan kaluai ni.",
            "",
            "4. Kungliangmei kross himdai pirun,",
            "He ringthao pui tingmik;",
            "Banchra guai kauh thang +:1 keina,",
            "Abumang phung kuni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
